# The Gatehouse — pick up the key, open the door, reach the yard.
@expect text Night settles on the old gatehouse porch.
@dismiss
@expect text A brass key glints on the bench beside a stone well.
@dismiss
look at the rim
@expect text stone well
@dismiss
flurb
@expect text don't know the word 'flurb'
@dismiss
@walkto 130,160
@snapshot behind_pillar
get key
@expect text You pocket the brass key.
@expect item key
@expect score 5
@expect flag seen_porch
@dismiss
unlock door
@expect text The key turns. The door swings open.
@expect score 10
@expect flag door_open
@dismiss
@walk e 80
@expect room yard
@expect text The yard is quiet. The lane waits beyond an iron fence.
@snapshot yard
